us, Bobbi and her parents will arrive at their destination at 4:30 p.m.\n\nTherefore, the final answer is \\boxed{4:30 \\, \\text{p.m.}}."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{4:30 \\, \\text{p.m.}}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
